      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Arteritis of the coronary arteries is a rare phenomenon. The cause is not always known. Transient ischaemia and even thrombosis of the arteries may be seen. The case of a 35 year-old man who died following myocardial infarction are presented and discussed. Even younger people with severe chest pain ought to be hospitalized immediately."},
